hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1077","Abdul Rahman bin Bishr bin Al-Hakam told us, Yahya bin Saeed, on the authority of Hisham, my father told me, on the authority of Aisha, that the Prophet prayed May God bless him and grant him peace, “He would pray thirteen rak’ahs of the night, of which he would perform Witr with five of them. He would not sit in any of the five rak’ahs except in the fifth.”"
